Implement the following calculations carefully.

Total Revenue = Recognized BioSoil Sales + Recognized Subscription Revenue + Recognized Commissions + Recognized Buyer Service Revenue + Recognized Implementation Revenue.

Gross Profit = Revenue − Applicable Direct Costs.

Operating Profit = Gross Profit − Operating Expenses.

Closing Cash = Opening Cash + Actual Cash Inflows − Actual Cash Outflows.

Do not confuse revenue with cash received.

Do not subtract the full produce transaction value as an IngogaBridge expense if it is a third-party farmer sale handled as an agent. Use an appropriate accounting model for the actual contractual arrangement.

